  "consumed": "AssKick Primary",
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost Per Dose:</strong> 100eb (Premium)</p>\n<p><em>Is it a refreshment? A dietary supplement? A drug? Does it matter? Open up a can of AssKick, and try our new fruit flavor - purple!</em></p>\n<p><strong>⋙</strong> <strong>PRIMARY EFFECT</strong> <strong>⋘</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Lasts 4 Hours.</li>\n<li>For the duration of the primary effect, the first damage the user suffers (after armor) in a Round is reduced by 1, or by 2 if the user also suffered a Critical Injury as part of taking the damage.</li>\n<li>For the duration of the Primary Effect, the user’s COOL and TECH are reduced by 2 (Minimum 1).</li>\n<li>The user feels ‘amped up’ and ‘ready to kick ass’ as if they lack a fear response. Do your best to roleplay accordingly.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>⋙</strong> <strong>SECONDARY EFFECT (DV17)</strong> <strong>⋘</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>If the user wasn’t addicted to Asskick, they are now. While addicted, the user suffers a -2 penalty to Checks made with the following Skills unless they are currently experiencing the Primary Effect of AssKick: Athletics, Concentration, Endurance, Perception, Stealth, and Tactics.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 100eb (Premium) per dose<br>\n<strong>Type:</strong> Street Drug</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>While addicted, switch on the \"AssKick Addiction\" effect.</li>\n<li>When an addicted character doses, use \"AssKick Addicted Primary\" instead of the normal primary effect; it cancels the withdrawal penalties for the duration.</li>\n<li>Stat and skill changes are automated; caps, minimums, durations, and everything else are not.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Gear, Drugs, &amp; Frames &gt; Consumables &gt; Street Drugs).</em></p>"
  },
